    The patch adds 'Gemini' to the choices list in cli.py.
    """
    # We need to import cli and check the choices list directly
    # because the new function uses click and questionary, which is hard to mock.
    import mle.cli
    # Examine the source code of the new function to see the choices.
    # Instead, we'll directly check the line in the file.
